    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "Solitary grievance of the applicant appears to be long pendency of Case No. 1175 of 2017 under Sections 498A, 323, 504, 506 IPC and Section 3/4 D.P. Act, Police Station Sarai Inayat, District Allahabad before the Additional Chief Judicial Magistrate, Room No. 9 Allahabad.\nIn view of the above, application is disposed of at this stage with a direction, in case applicant files a copy of this order before the learned court below, it shall make best efforts to conclude the proceedings as expeditiously as possible, without allowing for undue or long adjournments to either party.\nOrder Date :- 22.3.2023",
